My first Samurai ascension (and now 4/13 of the way to my goal
of ascending in each class). There were several false starts
including one "celestial disgrace" (oh, the shame!) and two
deaths-by-Pestilence before this one.

The most unusual thing about this game was that, due to some good
luck with pets and a magic whistle, I managed to clean out a potion
store around dlvl 4, and to boost my charisma up just enough
to make playing with succubi worthwhile. As a result of one particularly
friendly succubus, I found myself at experience level 30 before I had
managed to explore below dlvl 8. So I was 30th level, and wearing
the armor and such typical of about a 9th level character.

The endgame was complicated slightly by having no way to detect the
portals, so I had to do it the brute force way (I couldn't wear the AoY,
as I needed my AoR to provide reflection). Knowing that was coming,
I did arrange to genocide class 'v', which made some of the elemental
planes a lot quicker.

The high altar was, naturally, the last one I tried, but wands
of teleportation, wands of death, and a couple of scrolls of taming
(swarm, my little ant minions, swarm!) were very helpful.

Without further ado, I present Javelin the Shogun.

